    "intro": {
      "zh": "NeXT Computer 是乔布斯离开苹果后创立的 NeXT 公司于 1988 年推出的黑色立方体工作站，以 NeXTSTEP 系统闻名，是万维网诞生的机器。",
      "en": "The NeXT Computer, launched in 1988 by Steve Jobs' NeXT, was a black-cube workstation famous for NeXTSTEP and known as the machine on which the World Wide Web was born."
    },
    "spec_version": "0.2",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine_min_version": "0.1.0",
    "precision_level": "L2",
    "era": 1988,
    "manufacturer": "NeXT",
    "category": "workstation",
    "description": "NeXT Computer（1988），乔布斯的黑色立方体工作站：68030+DSP56001、磁光盘 256MB、NeXTSTEP 系统、万维网诞生地。演示向（Previous/OpenStep 预留）。",
